          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சந்தடி — cantaṭi — \"bustle; commotion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காலையில் சந்தையில் ஒரே சந்தடி. kālaiyil cantaiyil orē cantaṭi. In the morning there is nothing but bustle in the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சந்தடி (cantaṭi) இல்லாமல் means quietly, without fuss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சந்தடி (cantaṭi), \"bustle, noise of a crowd\", is a Tamil word whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
